  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>radix-histogram · 1×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 256 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-core-sort-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-core-sort-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">const ELEMENT_COUNT: u32 = 1024u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">const BIT_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">const BUCKET_COUNT: u32 = 16u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const DIGIT_MASK: u32 = 15u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"6\">const WORKGROUP_COUNT: u32 = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const ELEMENTS_PER_THREAD: u32 = 8u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"8\">const TILE_SIZE: u32 = 2048u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const KEYS_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"10\">const HISTOGRAM_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"11\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; keys: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; histogram: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; digitCounts: array&lt;atomic&lt;u32&gt;, 16&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"15\">@compute @workgroup_size(256) fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">    (workgroupId.z * 1u + workgroupId.y) * 1u + workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= WORKGROUP_COUNT) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">  for (var bucket = localInvocationIndex; bucket &lt; BUCKET_COUNT; bucket += 256u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">    atomicStore(&amp;digitCounts[bucket], 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  let tileBase = workgroupIndex * TILE_SIZE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  for (var slot = 0u; slot &lt; ELEMENTS_PER_THREAD; slot++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">    let index = tileBase + slot * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">    if (index &lt; ELEMENT_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">      let key = keys[KEYS_OFFSET + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">      let digit = (key &gt;&gt; BIT_OFFSET) &amp; DIGIT_MASK;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">      let bucket = DIGIT_MASK - digit;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">      atomicAdd(&amp;digitCounts[bucket], 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  for (var bucket = localInvocationIndex; bucket &lt; BUCKET_COUNT; bucket += 256u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">    histogram[HISTOGRAM_OFFSET + bucket * WORKGROUP_COUNT + workgroupIndex] =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">      atomicLoad(&amp;digitCounts[bucket]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>keys<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"rainfallTenthsMm\">rainfallTenthsMm</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>histogram<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"rainfall-sort-radix-digit-0-histogram\">rainfall-sort-radix-digit-0-histogram</td><td>write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUSort/radix-histogram · main · 7aeddf26</figcaption></figure></section>",
